        "PMC11330973::web::004::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mg-containing Al55Mg35Li5Zn5 can form multiple intermetallic compounds, including Al3Mg2, LiMgAl2, and Mg32(AlZn)49.",
